## Article 80. Appeal Deadlines

```catala
declaration scope Article80Appeal:
  input daysSinceNotification content integer
  input hasValidReasonForDelay content YesNo
  output appealAccepted content YesNo

scope Article80Appeal:
  label default_rejected definition appealAccepted equals No
  
  label accepted_on_time exception default_rejected
  definition appealAccepted under condition
    daysSinceNotification <= 30
    consequence equals Yes
    
  label accepted_delayed exception default_rejected
  definition appealAccepted under condition
    daysSinceNotification > 30 and hasValidReasonForDelay = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
